# Northstar Studio

## Welcome to the Future of Creative Work

Northstar Studio is a next-generation creative suite designed for modern makers, designers, and content creators. Built from the ground up with performance, flexibility, and collaboration in mind, Northstar Studio empowers teams to bring their boldest ideas to life.

---

## Whats Inside

Northstar Studio combines powerful tools with an intuitive interface:

- **Canvas Pro** - Vector and raster editing in one unified workspace
- **Timeline X** - Professional-grade video and motion graphics editing
- **Collab Hub** - Real-time team collaboration with version history
- **Asset Cloud** - Secure, fast asset management with smart organization
- **Export Suite** - One-click export to 50+ formats and platforms

---

## Key Features

| Feature | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| **AI-Powered Assist** | Smart suggestions for design, layout, and optimization |
| **Cross-Platform Sync** | Work seamlessly across desktop, tablet, and web |
| **Plugin Ecosystem** | Extend functionality with 100+ community plugins |
| **Offline Mode** | Full functionality without internet connectivity |
| **Enterprise Ready** | SSO, audit logs, and advanced security controls |

---

